  "description": "**Email Enquiries only**\nBrant & Co Property Consultants are excited to introduce this bright and well-presented 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment - 21C Quay Street, Balbriggan.\n\nThis first floor apartment offers a comfortable and clean living space. It offers an open plan kitchen and living room space. The property benefits a convenient location in Balbriggan, located on Quay Street, by the harbour, which has recently undergone a regeneration project, with a range of local amenities, shops, cafés and restaurants available nearby.\n\nProperty features:\n\n1 spacious bedroom\n1 bathroom\nBright and comfortable living accommodation\nWell-connected location\nClose to local amenities and transport links such as Balbriggan train station\nConvenient access to Balbriggans Millfield, Dunnes Stores, SuperValu, Mainstreet Balbriggan and Tesco.\n\nEarly viewing is recommended.",
